Description: Powerful yet simple-to-use screenshot software
 Flameshot provides screenshot capture, annotation, pinned images,
 a D-Bus interface and graphical and command-line interfaces for Linux.
 This build uses Rust and supports X11 and desktop screenshot portals.
 Optional Imgur integration is included; application update checking is
 disabled in distribution packages.
